      "new": "Comparing probabilities of public output histories requires a different test. *Institutional Linking and Realization*, Section 22, compares the full laws of finite public words in a fixed finite stochastic model \\[[1](#ref-linking){style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;hyphens:none\"}\\]. Equal public probabilities preserve that observation interface. They do not, by themselves, preserve debts or authority omitted from it.",
